	(text "Shared interfaces (not simultaneous):\nRemove ESP-01 before gamepad firmware drives GPIO21: ESP TX is push-pull.\nDisconnect UART J2 when using the PS/2 mouse; connect only HDMI or VGA, not both.\nPower: J1 is a rail breakout, not an isolated auxiliary input. No USB-C current detection.\nSize the 5 V source for board + peripherals, within F1; a PC USB port may not support the full load."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
